    ["Modal so‘zlar gapda qanday ajratiladi?", "Vergul bilan."],
    ["Ishonch, tasdiq modal so‘zlari?", "Albatta, shubhasiz, haqiqatan, darhaqiqat."],
    ["Gumon, taxmin modal so‘zlari?", "Shekilli, ehtimol, aftidan, chamasi, taxminan."],
